{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16009","headline":"鸡鸣曲 · 王建","name":"鸡鸣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡初鸣，明星照东屋。\n鸡再鸣，红霞生海腹。\n百官待漏双阙前，圣人亦挂山龙服。\n宝钗命妇灯下起，环佩玲珑晓光里。\n直内初烧玉案香，司更尚滴铜壶水。\n金吾衞里直郎妻，到明不睡听晨鸡。\n天头日月相送迎，夜栖旦鸣人不迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}